  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coffee Expansion Production- CA MUUNGANO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee.Beneficiaries: 4230 (1736 women).Description: The group seeks to consolidate its investment in its washing station and establish a working capital fund to ensure a more consistent supply chain to members. They will also invest in transport capacity to better serve 9 of their 16 production groups that are currently underserved..</narrative>
